Third-party data

The sample elevation data in input/venable.tif is a clipped version of the
200 m mosaic of the Reference Elevation Model of Antarctica (REMA), version 2,
and is not covered by the MIT License above. It is licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). See input/venable.tif_credit.txt.

